# Source-of-intent for the Django API image. Loose ranges live HERE; the
# fully-pinned, hashed lock is the generated requirements.txt next to it.
# Regenerate after editing this file with:
#   pip-compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt --generate-hashes
# Upper bounds cap each dep below its next major so a recompile (or Dependabot)
# never crosses a major boundary without a deliberate edit here.
